Z||000000||b52buf||07-25-2001||11:55 AM||||Does anyone out there have any idea where I can buy an aluminum vale cover (cast or stamped) A stamped steel chrome plated one will do.<BR>Any help appreciated.<BR>Thanx<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000001||qwikgta||07-25-2001||12:52 PM||||b52buf,<BR>  Try to use the search, I looked for one a while back and found a great site with a tubbed fiero on the web site,  Look for tubbed fiero or chrome parts.  If you find the link you will know because you will go to a site with a blue tubbed fiero.  On the wall in the background is chrome everything, engine, brake, misc...you name it.  Good luck<P>Rob<P>------------------<BR>qwikgta@yahoo.com<BR>88 T-Top coupe, 65K, Header no Cat, 16" GTZ rims, short shifter, swaybar, open element air cleaner, hood vents.<BR>http://www.homestead.com/robsfieroproject   <BR>http://www.vafieros.com<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigpic2.jpg"> ||||reg||1
